| i | socio | plan | meses | entr. | tarifa | subtotal | % desc | descuento | adicional | totalPagar | totalRecaudado | contVIPBlack | mayorPago |
|---|-------|------|-------|-------|--------|----------|--------|-----------|-----------|------------|----------------|--------------|-----------|
| 1 | Ana | 2 | 6 | 1 | 35 | 210 | 0.10 | 21 | 60 | **249** | 249 | 1 | 249 (Ana) |
| 2 | Luis | 3 | 12 | 2 | 50 | 600 | 0.15 | 90 | 0 | **510** | 759 | 2 | 510 (Luis) |

**Salida final:** recaudo = **$759.00** · VIP/Black = **2** · promedio = 759 / 2 = **$379.50** · mayor pago = Luis ($510.00).

